          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 3f6fc46dd5f94ef654b685b11fbb64f0700bb78e8da3dba9fcb55525915202d0\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: 07e6da46b9ea7945fdd6893f0d792b6231d2f6085ce90c316e086dea80b55194\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the switch to use the maximum prefixes feature to protect against route table flooding and prefix de-aggregation attacks as shown in the example below:\n\nSW1(config)#router bgp xx\nSW1(config-switch)#neighbor x.1.1.9 maximum-prefix nnnnnnn\nSW1(config-switch)#neighbor x.2.1.7 maximum-prefix nnnnnnn",
