          "fix_text": "Enable split horizon on all PE switches deploying VPLS in a full-mesh configuration.\n\nSW1(config)#l2 vfi VPLS_A manual \nSW1(config-vfi)#neighbor 10.3.3.3 encapsulation mpls",
