          "fix_text": "Configure the switch to drop IPv6 packets containing an option type value of 0x8A (Endpoint Identification) regardless of whether it appears in a Hop-by-Hop or Destination Option header as shown in the example below.\n\nSW1(config)#ipv6 access-list FILTER_IPV6\nSW1(config-ipv6-acl)#deny 60 any any dest-option log\nSW1(config-ipv6-acl)#permit …\n…\n…\n…\nSW1(config-ipv6-acl)#deny ipv6 any any log\nSW1(config-ipv6-acl)#exit\nSW1(config)#int g1/0\nSW1(config-if)#ipv6 traffic-filter FILTER_IPV6\nSW1(config-if)#end",
